---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Card from '../../components/Card.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Hair & Salon Calculators | Free Tools"
  description="Free, privacy-respecting calculators for salon cost estimates and hair growth planning."
  canonicalPath="/tools/"
>
  <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-14">
    <p class="text-xs text-ink/50 mb-2"><a href="/" class="hover:underline">Home</a> / Tools</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Tools</h1>
    <p class="text-ink/70 mb-4 max-w-2xl">
      Free calculators to help you plan a salon visit. Everything runs in your
      browser — no accounts, no data collection, no stored inputs.
    </p>
    <p class="text-ink/70 mb-8 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
      Planning ahead for a salon visit usually comes down to two questions: what
      will it roughly cost, and how long will it take to reach the look you want.
      Our two calculators are built to give quick, informational answers to those
      questions before you ever pick up the phone to book. Neither tool sends your
      inputs anywhere — the math happens entirely on your device, and nothing is
      stored once you close the tab. Use them as a starting point for budgeting
      and planning, then confirm exact pricing and timelines directly with your
      stylist, since real quotes always depend on the specifics of your hair and
      the professional you're working with.
    </p>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
      <Card eyebrow="Free Tool" title="Salon Cost Calculator" description="Estimate a rough price range for common salon services based on your inputs." href="/tools/salon-cost-calculator/" />
      <Card eyebrow="Free Tool" title="Hair Length Calculator" description="Estimate how long it will take to grow hair from your current to desired length." href="/tools/hair-length-calculator/" />
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
